OL,3,AHow drones are hunting fires hidden
OL,4,Abeneath the Cairngorms
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is 06:00 and I'm meeting drone pilot
OL,7,FPete Short for a dawn patrol in the
OL,8,FCairngorms National Park.
OL,10,FIt is a job he has been doing for
OL,11,Falmost three months, since a huge
OL,12,Fwildfire tore through this landscape in
OL,13,FJuly.
OL,15,FThe flames which swept across the
OL,16,Fhillsides are gone. From where we are
OL,17,Fstanding, there is little to suggest
OL,18,Fthere is still a fire here at all.
OL,20,FBut that is exactly what we have come
OL,21,Fto find.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
