OL,3,APrize-winning image which sparked
OL,4,Abacklash was AI-generated, Nikon rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it would now look at the rules
OL,7,Fand procedures of the annual contest,
OL,8,Fwhich has been running for 15 years and
OL,9,Fis specifically for microscopic images.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
