OL,3,AScreams, haunting scenes and deadly
OL,4,Ahide-and-seek, as Celebrity Traitors
OL,5,Aheats up
OL,6,
OL,7,FFriday's episode saw the Traitors at it
OL,8,Fagain, murdering Last of Us actor Bella
OL,9,FRamsey, before the faithfuls did their
OL,10,Fdirty work for them by banishing
OL,11,Fanother of their own, Julie
OL,12,FHesmondhalgh.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
