OL,3,AUS country music star Ella Langley
OL,4,Acancels show due to 'security threat'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS country music star Ella Langley has
OL,7,Fsaid she had to cancel her sold-out
OL,8,Fconcert in Tulsa, Oklahoma due to a
OL,9,F"serious security threat".
OL,11,FThe singer made what she called the
OL,12,F"incredibly difficult" decision around
OL,13,Ftwo hours before the show at the
OL,14,F19,000-seater arena was due to start on
OL,15,FFriday night.
OL,17,FThe 27-year-old wrote on Instagram that
OL,18,Fthe threat involved "the safety of my
OL,19,Ffans, the venue staff and my team".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
